From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 21:27:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add scene-adaptive opaque emission with delayed luminance
 readback

Publish the actual auto-exposure geometric mean and paired exposure through
three nonblocking readback slots and the shared raytracing constants. Keep
the 64-byte material layout by packing the optional half-float across spare
index and DLSS-alpha bytes, preserving the legacy zero-input record.

Apply the opt-in intensity in opaque and Source-eye evaluation, keep fixed
fallbacks and blend influence, expose scale/clamps/fallback options, and log
sample age, luminance and exposure at camera cuts and five-minute intervals.
Cover USD loading, clamping, hashing, packing and the emission formula.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
